      "created_at": "2026-03-23T03:28:07.820Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Simply missed submitting the graded week 5 assignment because I had completed all the programming assignments and inadvertently believed that I had completed the assignments. This one just slipped through the cracks simply because amid work, 4 courses and Quiz 1, I failed to check that this was not submitted.</p>\n<p>I could have done the assignment with 15-20 mins. It doesn’t affect any eligibilities but I feel terrible!</p>",
